{"scraped_at": "2026-06-04T07:26:16.694941+00:00", "run_id": "20260604_072616", "page": 63, "api_response": {"count": 3946, "per_page": 20, "current_page": 63, "total_pages": 198, "next": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=64&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "previous": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=62&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "results": [{"review_id": 549089387, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r549089387-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Another important must see place", "text": "The temple is very crowded so go with enough time at hand. Beware of touts and people offering to take smaller routes to get you glimpse of the God. Best is to follow what normal people are doing. Well managed by the temple staff otherwise. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2017-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "58A111195BC8C92D80D1FA6FAE260DF6", "name": "Sumeet J", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/SumeetJ696", "username": "SumeetJ696", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/08/14/20/35/sumeet-j.jpg", "contribution_count": 168, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304551, "location_name": "New Delhi", "location_name_detailed": "New Delhi, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2017-12-25", "published_at_date": "2017-12-25"}, {"review_id": 549051808, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r549051808-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Great Sight", "text": "Here it's definitely worth to take a \"guide\". You easily find inside some people who tell you for a tip something about the Nepali culture and the Temple. Be careful with the monkeys...don't hold food or soft drinks in your hands...they will take it. Otherwise the whole Temple is just a really Holly place and it's surrounded by a special atmosphere. Be respectful to the familys who burn their loved once there.\nA must to do in Kathmandu...it's the second most important Hindu Temple in the world after the Nepalese. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2017-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CB2C03B906AED5527DBD83E4923A89C4", "name": "Eva H", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/evah214", "username": "evah214", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f1/79/default-avatar-2020-21.jpg", "contribution_count": 43, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2017-12-24", "published_at_date": "2017-12-25"}, {"review_id": 548887839, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r548887839-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Must see", "text": "This was an extraordinary experience.  You get to experience the culture and beliefs.  It was fascinating.  Be prepared to pay for pictures taken of the monks.  Very interesting life and death beliefs.  Overall very informative.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {